{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Among the elim.</b> They are the holy angels on high, and 'sons of elim' are the stars, and I shall further explain this in the portion of Ki Tissa:" "<b>Enthroned in holiness.</b> It is the Throne of Glory." "And the sense of 'awesome in praises' is that all who praise Him are in awe of praising His name, for who can express all His praise? And they are obligated to praise His name, for He alone performs wonders."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:42.388186871Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}